念出咒语的时候，必然集中注意力，而在这短暂的时间里，尤为关键。如果没有强力的武者在旁边守护，召唤师很容易陷入危机之中。守护师和召唤师之间那是一种心灵上的互相信任。是愿意把后背交给对方的信任。强大有名的召唤师往往不止一个守护师。当然，反之，有的很弱的召唤师是没有人愿意当他的守护师的。凌飞扬转头看着校长和高老师，两人一致点头笑眯眯的说道：“那骆少这顿饭请定了！”凌飞扬笑起来，他那绝美的容颜上绽放出一个灿烂的笑，直看的人心神荡漾。“如此，那我是赚了。惊风，不要以为普通的一顿饭就可以打发我。”凌飞扬笑着。“等你赢了再废话吧。”骆惊风依旧凉飕飕的说道。校长和高老师都信心十足的对凌飞扬笑，笑的脸都快成一朵菊花了。召唤仪式，很快就要开始。在广场上，忽然响起一阵震天的鼓声。那是召唤仪式即将开始的信号。一瞬间，广场上安静了下来。“各位学员，很高兴又一届的召唤仪式隆重举行。今天，见证我们白羽书院辉煌的时刻又道了。我希望今天各位全力以赴，希望参加仪式的学员们，都能成功召唤出属于自己的魔宠。都能顺利通过召唤师的考核！你们将会是我们白羽学院的骄傲，你们将会是我们白羽学院的荣耀。努力吧，你们终将会是帝国的栋梁！”校长站了起来，发表了一通慷慨激昂的说辞。说了那么长一段，都不带喘的，显然这番说辞不知道重复多少遍了。诸葛明月没有理会这些陈词滥调，在她的记忆中，这段话，学院里不少人都可以倒背如流了。每一次的召唤仪式他都要来这么一段，标点符号都不带改的。她在观察那个巨大的法阵。在记忆中，第一次召唤都要借助这个法阵的力量。“召唤仪式开始！”校长一声高喝，震天的鼓声再次响起。鼓声停下后，广场上一片寂静，气氛庄重起来。学员们个个面色凝重。这次参加召唤仪式的学员们，都站在了巨大法阵的周围，只等一声令下就入阵。“入阵——”随着在法阵旁边一位老师的高喊，在法阵四角的人，将手中的雕刻着奇异古老文字的玉石放入了四角的阵眼中，启动了法阵。法阵启动，整个阵中，白光大甚，灿烂炫目。接着，参加仪式的学员们一个个的走了进去。诸葛明月也一脸平静的缓缓进入了阵法。学员们都站在了阵法当中，闭上眼睛，开始全神贯注的感受魔宠，低沉的念着咒语。这一次参加召唤仪式的人，有二十八个人。很快就有人召唤出了自己的魔宠，一个，两个，三个……随着召唤魔宠的人越来越多，法阵中的白光在渐渐的削弱。校长非常满意的看着下面，召唤出魔宠的学员们个个喜气洋洋，带着自己刚召唤出来的魔宠，去旁边负责登记的老师那登记去了。人在一个个的离去，法阵中的白光在渐渐消失。站在法阵旁边的薛子皓放下心来了，因为他看到了他的好友万俟辰成功的召唤出了一只魔宠。那是一只地甲兽，属于防御类的。地甲兽全身拥有坚硬的鳞甲，普通的刀剑根本伤不了它。这地甲兽在防御类的魔宠中是资质极好的了。薛子皓握了握拳，口中低喝：“胖子，好样的！”薛子皓激动的冲万俟辰挥手，但是万俟辰召唤了魔宠后却没有马上带着魔宠出法阵，而是担心的看向了诸葛明月。此刻诸葛明月的周围已经没有人了，就她一个人还站在那里。她闭着眼睛，轻启朱唇，在缓缓的念着咒语。只是，过了这么久，依旧没有任何的动静！难道，她这次又会失败？这是她最后一次机会了啊。难道她这一生都不可能成为召唤师么？万俟辰想到这里，揪心不已。随着时间的流逝，法阵中的人在不断的走出去。此次参加召唤仪式的二十八人中，有十五人召唤出了魔宠，有十二人失败，但是他们都没有气馁，因为他们还有机会。万俟辰最后在薛子皓的催促中缓缓走出了法阵，但是目光却一直停留在诸葛明月的身上。偌大的法阵，此刻就只剩下诸葛明月一个人了。法阵中的白光也已经消失殆尽。而诸葛明月，依旧没有任何的动静。不少人已经嗤笑出声，认定了诸葛明月不可能召唤出魔宠了。“得了吧，她还在那浪费时间。老师怎么不去把她叫出来？”万俟辰旁边一个打扮的可爱的女生娇声开口。“你闭嘴！臭三八！”万俟辰毫不客气的呵斥。“你，你骂我？万俟辰，你疯了，你居然为了鸡窝头骂我？”那可爱的女生和万俟辰正是一个班的。长相还不错的她，平时打扮的可爱，更是惹的不少男生追求。男生们对她那可都是和颜悦色的。今天被万俟辰这样训斥，一时之间根本就接受不了。再加上今日看到鸡窝头头发梳理好了路出脸来居然是那样的漂亮，她心理更加暴躁了。“骂你又怎么了？再废话我还打你。”万俟辰挥舞了一下胖胖的拳头威胁着。那女生一见万俟辰脸上的阴狠，知道对方绝非说笑，缩了缩脖子，不说话了。只是眼中闪过了一抹恼怒，转头看向法阵中的诸葛明月时，眼神变成了怨毒。诸葛明月对周围的质疑声视若无睹，她还是静静的站在那里。“惊风，呵呵，你可别想普通的一顿饭就打发我。我要在帝都的麒麟酒店最豪华的包厢，而且要最好的酒，就上次喝过的那个有三百年年限的……”凌飞扬斜靠在椅子上，慵懒的用手肘支撑着下巴，缓缓的说着。那模样，说不出的风情，说不出的魅惑。“你这话还早了点。我就怕一会你哭都哭不出来。”骆惊风冷笑一声，打击着凌飞扬。这两人的相处模式，就是这般看似恶劣。若不知道两人关系的，还以为他们是敌对。若是用诸葛明月的话来总结，这两人就是损友。“好吧，我们拭目以待，拭目以待，呵呵。骆少啊……本少爷可是等着呢。”凌飞扬轻笑一声，又转头看向广场中的法阵。诸葛明月还独自站在法阵中，她周围都空荡荡的，显得她一个人是那样的突兀。就在法阵旁边的老师都不耐烦了，准备出声催促诸葛明月还是赶紧出来的时候……异象突起！－－－－－－题外话－－－－－－目前等级的划分：剑士：初级、中级、高级、大地剑士、天空剑士、灵魂剑士、圣剑士帝级剑士、大宗师，苍穹剑士、神级、破神级、尊级、天尊级、至尊弓箭手：初级、中级、高级、大地弓箭手、天空弓箭手、灵魂弓箭手、圣弓箭手帝级弓箭手、大宗师弓箭手，苍穹弓箭手、神级、破神级、尊级、天尊级、至尊召唤师：初级、中级、高级、大地召唤师、天空召唤师、灵魂召唤师、圣召唤师帝级召唤师、大宗师召唤师，苍穹召唤师、神级、破神级、尊级、天尊级、至尊", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/fuheikuangnu-qingchengzhaohuanshi/3.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 3 Bet \"No, Mr. Luo, her qualifications are extremely poor. No one knows her better than me.\" The teacher hurriedly vowed, \"She didn't even recite the spell completely the first two times. How could such a person summon a magic pet and become a summoner?\" \"Yes, Teacher Gao is Zhuge Mingyue's teacher. If he says so, he can't be wrong.\" The principal also helped. \"Since that's the case, it can't be wrong.\" Ling Feiyang said nonchalantly with a smile in his eyes. \"Don't be so sure, what if she summons it?\" Luo Jingfeng sneered, \"Feiyang, what if she summons it? Should we make a bet?\" \"What bet?\" Ling Feiyang became more energetic when he heard the bet, \"What do you mean you bet!\" \"If she can summon a demon pet, then you can be her guardian. If she doesn't summon a demon pet, I will treat you to dinner.\" Luo Jingfeng said slowly. Most summoners have a guardian, who is a swordsman or archer. Guardians are very important to Summoners. This is because the summoner must concentrate when summoning a demon pet to recite a spell, and this is particularly critical during this short period of time. If there are no powerful warriors guarding him, the summoner can easily fall into crisis. There is a kind of spiritual mutual trust between the guardian and the summoner. It is trust that is willing to give the other person's back. Powerful and famous summoners often have more than one guardian. Of course, on the other hand, there are some very weak summoners that no one wants to be their guardians. Ling Feiyang turned to look at the principal and Teacher Gao. They both nodded in unison and said with smiles: \"Then Mr. Luo will treat you to this meal!\" Ling Feiyang laughed, and a bright smile bloomed on his beautiful face, making everyone who looked at him feel excited. \"So, then I've made a profit. Jingfeng, don't think that an ordinary meal can kill me.\" Ling Feiyang smiled. \"Don't talk nonsense until you win.\" Luo Jingfeng said still coolly. The principal and Teacher Gao both smiled confidently at Ling Feiyang, their smiling faces almost turned into chrysanthemums. The summoning ceremony will begin soon. In the square, a loud drumbeat suddenly sounded. That was the signal that the summoning ceremony was about to begin. For a moment, the square became quiet. \"Students, I am very happy that another summoning ceremony has been held. Today is another moment to witness the glory of our White Feather Academy. I hope that you will go all out today and that all the students participating in the ceremony can successfully summon their own magic pets and pass the summoner's assessment smoothly! You will be the pride of our White Feather Academy, and you will be the glory of our White Feather Academy. Work hard, and you will eventually be the pillars of the empire!\" The principal stood up and gave an impassioned speech. He spoke for such a long time without even taking a breath. It was obvious that he had repeated this statement countless times. Zhuge Mingyue ignored these clichés. In her memory, many people in the college knew this passage by heart. He has to do this part of every summoning ceremony without changing the punctuation marks. She was observing the huge magic circle. In my memory, the first summons had to rely on the power of this magic circle. \"The summoning ceremony begins!\" the principal shouted, and the thundering drums sounded again. After the drumming stopped, the square fell silent and the atmosphere became solemn. The students all looked solemn. The students who participated in the summoning ceremony this time stood around the huge magic circle, waiting for the order to enter the formation. \"Enter the formation—\" As a teacher next to the formation shouted, the people at the four corners of the formation put the jade stones in their hands engraved with strange ancient characters into the four corners of the formation, and activated the formation. The magic circle was activated, and the white light in the entire array was extremely bright and dazzling. Then, the students who participated in the ceremony walked in one by one. Zhuge Mingyue also slowly entered the formation with a calm expression. The students all stood in the formation, closed their eyes, began to concentrate on feeling the magic pet, and chanted the spell in a low voice. This time, there were twenty-eight people participating in the summoning ceremony. Soon someone summoned their own magic pets, one, two, three... As more and more people summoned their magic pets, the white light in the magic circle gradually weakened. The principal looked down with great satisfaction. The students who had summoned their magic pets were all beaming with joy. They took their newly summoned magic pets to the registration teacher next to them to register. People were leaving one by one, and the white light in the magic circle was gradually disappearing. Xue Zihao, who was standing next to the magic circle, felt relieved because he saw his friend Wan Qichen successfully summoned a demon pet. It was an armored beast, a defensive type. The Earth Armored Beast has hard scales all over its body, and ordinary swords cannot hurt it at all. This armored beast has excellent qualifications among defensive familiars. Xue Zihao clenched his fists and shouted: \"Fat man, good job!\" Xue Zihao waved excitedly to Wan Qichen, but after Wan Qichen summoned his magic pet, he did not immediately take the magic pet out of the circle, but looked at Zhuge Mingyue worriedly. At this moment, there was no one around Zhuge Mingyue, and she was the only one still standing there. She closed her eyes, opened her red lips, and slowly recited the incantation. However, after so long, there is still no movement! Could it be that she will fail again this time? This is her last chance. Is it impossible for her to become a summoner in this life? Wan Qichen felt very worried when he thought of this. As time goes by, people in the circle are constantly walking out. Of the twenty-eight people who participated in the summoning ceremony this time, fifteen summoned their demon pets and twelve failed, but they were not discouraged because they still had a chance. Wan Qichen finally walked out of the magic circle slowly at Xue Zihao's urging, but his eyes remained on Zhuge Mingyue. The huge magic circle, at this moment", "title_en": "Chapter 3"}